			"date": "2023-03-09T14:50:29.844Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.online/@slab_bulkhead\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>slab_bulkhead</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@eleventy\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>eleventy</span></a></span> there is a perception on twitter that Eleventy development has slowed or stopped</p>",
