			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-03-09T14:52:14.422Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.ca/@jbwharris\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jbwharris</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@eleventy\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>eleventy</span></a></span> YES—exactly. Between the lines is pretty prominent right now</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "109993958902444346",
			"parentId": "109990548472649314",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/109993958902444346",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-03-09T15:10:17.043Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hachyderm.io/@nathansmith\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>nathansmith</span></a></span> Whew. I want to agree 100%. Unfortunately it’s a bit more complicated than that, especially as Eleventy overlaps with the JavaScript community just enough that the narrative about Eleventy on Twitter right now is either a ghost ship or worse: driven and controlled by Bro Dudes™ with less-than-friendly agendas.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "109994077328226184",
			"parentId": "109993958902444346",
			"url": "https://hachyderm.io/@nathansmith/109994077274303395",
			"author": {
				"name": "Nathan Smith",
				"url": "https://hachyderm.io/@nathansmith",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/383/370/107/534/016/original/20328698b9743655.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-03-09T15:40:23.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span></p><p>So, if I understand correctly…</p><p>1. Lack of Eleventy updates via Twitter are leading some folks to the conclusion that it's a \"dead\" project?</p><p>2. While others are spinning a story about Eleventy being stewarded by… What, a bunch of nefarious villains?</p><p>I think that says more about the toxicity of the JS community who remained on Twitter, than you or Eleventy as a whole.</p><p>I personally wouldn't expend the energy. Still, I can understand the desire to set the record straight.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "109994104820738782",
			"parentId": "109994077328226184",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@autiomaa/109994104520912319",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2023-03-09T15:47:19.000Z",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "109994108511179617",
			"parentId": "109994077328226184",
			"url": "https://hachyderm.io/@nathansmith/109994108478435870",
			"author": {
				"name": "Nathan Smith",
				"url": "https://hachyderm.io/@nathansmith",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/383/370/107/534/016/original/20328698b9743655.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-03-09T15:48:19.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span></p><p>From what I see on the eleven_ty Twitter account, it's not like people can't find out where to get info if they need it.</p><p>I guess I view putting effort into trying to \"control the narrative\" on Twitter as just throwing good money after bad, so to speak.</p><p>Winning an argument on Twitter, or engaging at all… Just pulls one back down into the muck.</p><p>Yay, victory! But then I would look around and wonder: \"Why did I even want to be here in the first place?\"</p><p>Anywho, that's just my 2 cents.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
