				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/301/142/710/280/103/original/76e81a9decf0b2b5.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-03-09T16:01:36.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@eleventy\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>eleventy</span></a></span> I wonder if you could post a weekly digest of what has been happening in 11ty world on mastodon. Then link to the elk.zone version of the post on Twitter. As someone who really enjoyed the UI of Twitter, elk has made the transition way easier. Not saying all the folks still on twitter need a better UI to make the switch, but maybe some do...</p><p>Regardless, thanks for all you do.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
