			"date": "2023-03-09T16:37:52.909Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@JackHPeterson\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>JackHPeterson</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@eleventy\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>eleventy</span></a></span> oh, I really like the idea of using this to push Mastodon. I do wonder if there is a lower-effort method! Some folks have suggested to cross post to Twitter with a link to the canonical mastodon post on each, which I like too!</p>",
